{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45142","headline":"秋日毘陵南寺送潘述之扬州 · 皎然","name":"秋日毘陵南寺送潘述之扬州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤客秋易伤，嘶蝉静仍续。\n佳晨亦已屡，欢会常不足。\n禅地非路岐，我心岂羁束。\n情生远别时，坐恨清景促。\n望中千里隔，暮归西山曲。\n萧条月中道，彩蒨原上绿。\n不见同心人，幽怀增踯躅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}